    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NAI NAI: [Hello?]\nBILLI: [Nai Nai. Hi!]\nNAI NAI: [Billi! It’s the middle of the night there, why aren’t you sleeping?]\nBILLI: [Middle of the night? It’s seven...]",
      "BILLI: I quit! Cuz I was about to get fired!\nBILLI: [Sorry, Nai Nai.]\nNAI NAI: [What was that?]\nBILLI: [Nothing. Just um... a friend...]",
      "LITTLE NAI NAI: [OK, let's go.]\nNAI NAI: [Did you talk to the doctor?]\nLITTLE NAI NAI: [Yep. You're in full health.]\nNAI NAI: [Really? What about the CT scan? What about the spots they saw before?]",
      "BILLI: How'd you get in here?\nNAI NAI: [Hi Billi. Sorry I hung up earlier.]\nBILLI: [That’s OK. What’s going on?]",
      "NAI NAI: [Billi? Is everything OK?]\nBILLI: [I’m fine. I’m uh... I’m just tired.]\nNAI NAI: [If you’re tired, go to bed!]"
    ]
  },
